        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. Admin inherits no invented SALE_STAFF identity; a design page is not a mounted dashboard or approved role migration. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/constants/product-permissions.js; backend/src/services/product-sales/product-order-management.service.js; backend/src/services/product-sales/product-management.service.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
